    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="details-grid">
    <article class="detail-card">
      <h3>🛠️ Biannual Performance Tuning</h3>
      <p>Two scheduled visits per year including a detailed inspection, safety tests, lubrication, and precision adjustments. Your door’s condition is documented at every visit.</p>
