      <p>Keypad or MyQ access allows us to complete maintenance while you’re at work. No need to stay home. Designed for busy households who don’t have time to schedule service appointments.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="detail-card">
      <h3>📉 25% Member Discount</h3>
      <p>Save 25% on non-wear items like new openers, electronics, remotes, and decorative hardware.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

<section class="multiple-doors-section">
 <p><i>Have multiple garage doors?</i> Ask about our Estate Discount for additional doors.
</p>
</section>

  <section class="no-card">
