      <TestimonialCard 
        quote="We never have to worry about surprise breakdowns or missed appointments. They're just always on it."
        author="Mark & Julia R."
      />
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="terms-section">
    <h2 class="sub-heading">Membership Terms & Eligibility</h2>
    <div class="terms-content">
      <div class="terms-column">
        <h4>The Essentials</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Certification:</strong> Door must pass an initial Performance Certification Inspection to qualify.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-Existing Conditions:</strong> Components identified as Poor or Failing during the initial Certification Inspection are not eligible for coverage until they are replaced.</li>
          <li><strong>Commitment:</strong> Requires a 12-month minimum commitment. Early cancellation results in billing for provided parts/labor at retail rates.</li>
          <li><strong>Exclusivity:</strong> Membership becomes void if any other party services the door system.</li>
        </ul>
