      <div class="terms-column">
        <h4>What's Not Covered</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Damage caused by forced operation of the door, impact, obstruction in the door’s path, or other abuse.</li>
          <li>Door sections/panels, tracks, and opener motor/rail assemblies.</li>
          <li>Cosmetic issues, rust, or environmental corrosion.</li>
          <li>Structural aging of the door system.</li>
          <li>Membership applies per door.</li>
