---

<BaseLayout {title} {description} legacy={false}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(membershipSchema)} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    title="Coming Soon"
    image="/photos/protection-garage-door-plans.avif"
    imageAlt="Performance Membership garage door maintenance"
    crumbs={[{ name: 'Services', href: '/services/services' }, { name: 'Performance Membership', href: '/services/performance-membership' }]}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow text-center stack-lg stack">
      <span class="eyebrow">Proactive Care</span>
      <h2>Performance Membership</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        We’re building something designed to completely change how homeowners care for their garage doors.
        A smarter, proactive approach to reliability, safety, and long-term performance.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        This premium service is currently in development and will be available once our systems are fully in place
        to deliver the level of service our customers expect.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactBlock text="Proactive care. Performance Membership - the smarter way to own a garage door in Central Michigan." />
</BaseLayout>
